WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:10.040
[music] Listen up: Thus says the Lord God.

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:24.920
When I gather the house of Israel from among the peoples where it has been scattered, God is concerned with gathering us together. Before I continue,

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:30.620
Tell anyone: "Hey, you—stand up and listen carefully." Say it like that.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:34.960
[noise] Now, look. The scattered words.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:38.780
...in verse twenty-five means:

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:48.840
Lack of community. And a tribal mentality. Lack of harmony and a true sanctuary.

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:58.820
A lack of dignity and faith. A lack of revelation that robs us of an understanding of our God.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:08.760
And who undermines our understanding of our vision, mission, doctrine, values, and culture.

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:22.780
God said: “I must gather together what has been scattered. Because when people scatter, the sense of community is lost.”

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:31.140
There's no tribal spirit. There's more harmony. There's more of a true sanctuary.

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:40.820
That's why, when you sang, "Oh, he's good," I said, "Lord, those people are going to kill me."

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:47.880
Here we go—just as I'd imagined. The time has come.

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:50.580
Impact Global Church.

00:01:50.600 --> 00:02:00.240
We need to pull together. We have to stop being scattered. Same mindset.

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:10.959
Same culture. Even the Impact Church in Kinshasa is causing us a lot of problems. People need to distance themselves from the demonic spirit of Kinshasa.

00:02:10.979 --> 00:02:20.760
Because over there, there's that demonic spirit.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:29.790
It affects politicians. It affects business owners. Even at church, too.

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:38.560
There's no harmony. When you go to Kinshasa, the only thing you'll find is the Impact Church. People try to do things the same way as they do here,

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:48.400
like the Impact, but it's not the Impact. When God brings us together.

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:55.560
As a single community.

00:02:55.580 --> 00:03:05.240
He said: “We will build houses. We reap what we have sown. The gathering.”

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:14.180
Referring to the same doctrine. Same culture. Same mindset.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:21.780
When a young person from Brussels talks with a young person from Abidjan, there shouldn't be any sense of a disconnect.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:25.100
There's harmony—it's the same group of young people.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:32.780
They drink from the same faucet. Why do young people in Abidjan have to embrace the Ivorian mindset?

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:42.300
What kind of work do the leaders do there? Oh, that's the mission God has given us.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:48.360
Say "Amen." I'm really mean to parents who talk to their kids at home about things that are diff-different from what I,

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:56.180
I'm saying this here. I have plenty of evidence that many parents do this.

00:03:56.200 --> 00:04:06.980
These are the devil's intentions regarding our church. That we lack a spirit of harmony,

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:21.520
harmonious, no tribalism, no shared vision. Verse twenty-five. Thus says the Lord God: “When I gather the house of Israel from among the peoples, from the nations where they have been scattered,

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:33.960
I will reveal my holiness through her in the sight of the nations, and they will dwell in the land I have given to my servant—that is, Jacob. Now, watch.

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:43.860
God speaks of the power of community—the power to respond to God’s initiative.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:53.960
to build a community based on the fact that, although we are scattered in spirit, we become one.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:05:03.400
With Safa's strength. The same mindset. The same philosophy. Let's all come together again around our shared vision.

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:11.320
Same doctrine. Establish the five terms of the covenant.

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:23.780
By revealing the true sanctuaries, God has spoken; let us respond appropriately to His words.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:33.290
God is building a new community through the apostolic-pastoral reform. He is bringing us together so that we may,

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:47.340
so that we may pursue the same goal and follow the apostolic and pastoral paths as Paul taught Titus and Timothy.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:57.160
Paul communicated to Timothy and Paul. I will teach you my ways.

00:05:57.180 --> 00:06:08.812
Just as I preach it, I preach it all over the world. My philosophy, my doctrine,

00:06:08.832 --> 00:06:12.332
That's what it's going to become now.

00:06:12.352 --> 00:06:17.052
When you try to, to, to step away from that,

00:06:17.072 --> 00:06:20.412
You're distracting us.

00:06:20.432 --> 00:06:24.252
It will be difficult for us to experience the glory of God.

00:06:24.272 --> 00:06:28.852
When God has finished bringing us together

00:06:28.872 --> 00:06:34.952
and when we are united with all those who serve Him,

00:06:34.972 --> 00:06:47.412
Then the nations will see this aspect of unity, solidarity, a shared vision, and a common purpose.

00:06:47.432 --> 00:06:51.712
The nations will say they have never seen anything like it.

00:06:51.732 --> 00:06:53.432
That's the impact.

00:06:53.452 --> 00:06:55.392
There's an important sentence there:

00:06:55.412 --> 00:06:59.632
along with all those who serve them.

00:06:59.652 --> 00:07:03.732
There shouldn't be any fighters who speak different languages.

00:07:03.752 --> 00:07:12.192
People who preach—even those in leadership roles here—when it comes to leading, everyone has their own personality and way of behaving.

00:07:12.212 --> 00:07:18.272
But those who shape the culture must be the same.

00:07:18.292 --> 00:07:19.512
Hallelujah.

00:07:19.532 --> 00:07:24.932
When we speak, our doctrines must be consistent.

00:07:24.952 --> 00:07:31.782
You cannot be both a celebrant and a preacher.

00:07:31.802 --> 00:07:37.032
When you talk about this, there's a disconnect between the doctrines.

00:07:37.052 --> 00:07:41.832
That will be proof that we're scattered.

00:07:41.852 --> 00:07:45.892
Can everyone see this?

00:07:45.912 --> 00:07:50.692
We preach the blood—we preach it; we preach the apostolic-pastoral.

00:07:50.712 --> 00:07:55.352
How much value does apostolic doctrine have, given that there are preachers?

00:07:55.372 --> 00:08:00.892
[silence]
